    "body": "Navigation wouldn't hit the fetch layer as navigation would dispatch to the OS for unknown schemes (we should consider limiting such dispatching to top-level navigations though). Such dispatch only uses the URL though I think so supporting POST might be a bit meaningless. Not sure if it's worth cleaning up.",
